<%- include('partials/top') %>
<div class="wrap narrow doc">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="muted">How EasyNotes, an independent South African business, handles your personal information under the Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA). Questions or requests about your information? Email <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a>.</p>

  <h2>Buyers</h2>
  <p>We store the name and email address you enter at checkout and your purchase details, so we can deliver your notes and let you download them again. Paystack processes your payment details under its own privacy policy; EasyNotes never receives your full card number.</p>
  <p>Sellers see a partly hidden version of your email address in their sales list. We don’t give your full email address to sellers.</p>

  <h2>Sellers</h2>
  <p>We store your name, email, password (encrypted), storefront details and the documents you upload for verification. Verification documents are kept in private storage, used only to confirm your qualifications, results and identity, and are visible only to the EasyNotes team. We delete the copy of your ID 30 days after you’re verified (or 60 days after a submission we couldn’t approve, if you don’t send it again). Students see the qualifications we’ve verified, your institution, when you finished or expect to finish, and any marks or distinction you choose to show. Bank details are sent to Paystack to create your payout account; we keep only your bank name and the last four digits of your account number.</p>

  <p>We record when you accept the own-work declaration on each upload and run automatic checks on uploaded PDFs for signs of copied material. If a rights holder makes a well-founded copyright complaint about your notes, we may share your name and contact details with them, as set out in the <a href="/seller-terms">seller terms</a>.</p>

  <h2>Reviews</h2>
  <p>To review a seller you confirm your purchase with your order reference and the email you paid with. We check these against the order but never show them. Your review shows your rating, what you wrote, the notes you bought and your first name and last initial from checkout. We may hide reviews that are abusive, off-topic or misleading.</p>

  <h2>Reports</h2>
  <p>If you report notes or send a takedown request, we store your report, name (if given) and email address so we can investigate and follow up. We don’t share them with the seller unless the law requires it.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>We use one essential cookie to keep you logged in and protect forms. We don’t use advertising cookies.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete your personal information by emailing <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a>. We keep purchase records for as long as required by law.</p>
</div>
<%- include('partials/bottom') %>
